{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14509","headline":"京口送皇甫司马副端曾舒州辞满归去东都 · 戴叔伦","name":"京口送皇甫司马副端曾舒州辞满归去东都","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"潮水忽复过，云帆俨欲飞。\n故园双阙下，左宦十年归。\n晚景照华发，凉风吹绣衣。\n淹留更一醉，老去莫相违。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戴叔伦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14509.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14509","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}